<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns:mc="http://www.mailchimp.com/ns/1.0">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title>Serpico AI :: Daily AI Brief</title>
  <style type="text/css">
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f0f2f5;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }

    table {
      border-collapse: collapse;
      mso-table-lspace: 0pt;
      mso-table-rspace: 0pt;
    }

    img {
      border: 0;
      display: block;
      height: auto;
      line-height: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
      outline: none;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a {
      color: #0073e6;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .preheader {
      color: #f0f2f5;
      display: none;
      font-size: 1px;
      line-height: 1px;
      max-height: 0;
      max-width: 0;
      opacity: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .wrapper {
      background-color: #f0f2f5;
      padding: 20px 0;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .container {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 6px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 600px;
      overflow: hidden;
      width: 600px;
    }

    .logo-header {
      background-color: #0d1b2e;
      padding: 24px 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .logo-header img {
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 400px;
      width: 400px;
    }

    .intro-block {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 32px 40px 20px;
    }

    .intro-block h1 {
      color: #0d1b2e;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .intro-block p {
      color: #555555;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .hero-block {
      line-height: 0;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .hero-block img {
      display: block;
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 600px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .hero-placeholder {
      background-color: #ddeeff;
      color: #0073e6;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      padding: 60px 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .body-block {
      padding: 28px 40px 36px;
    }

    .body-block p {
      color: #444444;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0 0 15px;
    }

    .body-block section {
      border-top: 1px solid #d9e0e5;
      margin: 22px 0 0;
      padding: 22px 0 0;
    }

    .body-block section:first-child {
      border-top: 0;
      margin-top: 0;
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    .body-block h2 {
      color: #0d1b2e;
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }

    .body-block h3 {
      color: #0d1b2e;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.35;
      margin: 0 0 6px;
    }

    .body-block article {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }

    .body-block article p {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin: 0 0 6px;
    }

    .body-block strong {
      color: #0d1b2e;
    }

    .body-block a.btn {
      background-color: #0073e6;
      border-radius: 5px;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding: 13px 30px;
    }

    .divider-block {
      line-height: 0;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .divider-block img {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .cta-block {
      background-color: #0d1b2e;
      padding: 36px 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta-block h2 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
    }

    .cta-block p {
      color: #a8bdd0;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
    }

    .cta-block a.cta-btn {
      background-color: #f5a623;
      border-radius: 5px;
      color: #0d1b2e !important;
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 13px 32px;
    }

    .footer {
      background-color: #f0f2f5;
      color: #999999;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      padding: 20px 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer p {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }

    .footer a {
      color: #999999;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
      .wrapper {
        padding: 0;
      }

      .container {
        border-radius: 0;
        width: 100% !important;
      }

      .logo-header,
      .intro-block,
      .body-block,
      .cta-block,
      .footer {
        padding-left: 22px !important;
        padding-right: 22px !important;
      }

      .logo-header img {
        max-width: 280px !important;
        width: 100% !important;
      }

      .cta-block h2 {
        font-size: 24px !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="preheader" mc:edit="preheader">
    Your daily AI brief from Serpico AI Learning Center.
  </div>

  <table class="wrapper" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table class="container" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
          <tr>
            <td class="logo-header">
              <img src="https://mcusercontent.com/<account-id>/images/0ce7f308-4079-72f1-3d96-c66dd291cc4d.png" alt="Serpico AI Learning Center" width="400">
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="intro-block">
              <div mc:edit="intro">
                <h1>Daily AI Brief</h1>
                <p>Today's curated AI updates, training highlights, and practical signals for business leaders.</p>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="hero-block">
              <div mc:edit="hero_image">
                <div class="hero-placeholder">
                  Insert hero image here. Recommended size: 600 x 300 px.
                </div>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="body-block">
              <div mc:edit="body">
                <section>
                  <h2>AI News That Matters</h2>
                  <p>A concise overview of the most useful AI developments for today's newsletter.</p>
                  <article>
                    <h3><a href="https://serpicoailc.com">Example story headline</a></h3>
                    <p>Use this area for generated article summaries from the app.</p>
                    <p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Connect the story to business value, learning opportunities, or implementation risk.</p>
                  </article>
                </section>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="divider-block">
              <img src="https://mcusercontent.com/<account-id>/images/902c0ae4-7495-6b44-c893-a6fffc630e0b.png" alt="" width="600">
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="cta-block">
              <h2>Solve your business problem in less than a day.</h2>
              <p>We begin with a discovery call. We then pair you with the right specialist to help you build a tailored solution for your business.</p>
              <p>Not a course. Not merely learning about AI. It is a real, working tool.</p>
              <a href="https://serpicoailc.com/register" class="cta-btn">Reserve Your 1:1 Expert Training</a>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="footer">
              <p>&copy; 2026 Serpico AI Learning Center &middot; Phoenix, AZ</p>
              <p>
                <a href="*|UNSUB|*">Unsubscribe</a> &middot;
                <a href="*|UPDATE_PROFILE|*">Update Preferences</a>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
